verdict good
note "integration-r5, first reference of the trimmed regression, read frame by frame: typing ca, cal, calc folds six rows away while the panel is held at 245 px with its card placed 90 px down; as the hold lets go at k27 the buffer shrinks to 65 px and the compositor re-centres it (origin 198 -> 288), and calculator, which stayed, is drawn at y 317 on screen before and after, the card and prompt at 288 and 297: nothing that stays moves"
